{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16597","headline":"同达奚宰游窦子明仙坛 · 朱湾","name":"同达奚宰游窦子明仙坛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松桧阴深一径微，中峰石室到人稀。\n仙官不住青山在，故老相传白日飞。\n华表问栽何岁木，片云留着去时衣。\n今朝茂宰寻真处，暂驻双凫且莫归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱湾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}